00:39:45,420 --> 00:39:46,620
This kid...

579
00:40:05,510 --> 00:40:06,800
What are you doing?!

580
00:40:11,930 --> 00:40:13,780
I said what are you doing?!

581
00:40:15,820 --> 00:40:17,160
Mr. Kanthi, I...

582
00:40:19,950 --> 00:40:22,360
You want to replace my mother
that much, huh?!

583
00:40:22,520 --> 00:40:24,160
It's not like that, Mr. Kanthi.

584
00:40:33,100 --> 00:40:36,200
Leech off my father
as much as you'd like,

585
00:40:36,550 --> 00:40:38,400
but don't ever cross the line
when it comes to my mother!

586
00:40:38,610 --> 00:40:39,610
What's going on?!

587
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:45,040
Your new wife took down Mom's photo,

588
00:40:45,280 --> 00:40:47,240
and replaced it with this shit instead!

589
00:40:50,310 --> 00:40:51,920
I told Mai to do it.

590
00:40:55,530 --> 00:40:56,400
Dad...

591
00:40:57,810 --> 00:40:59,080
How the hell could you?

592
00:41:00,100 --> 00:41:01,840
That's our family photo!

593
00:41:02,710 --> 00:41:04,020
This is my house.

594
00:41:04,610 --> 00:41:06,440
I can do whatever I want!

595
00:41:11,690 --> 00:41:12,600
Yes...

596
00:41:13,540 --> 00:41:14,790
This is your house.

597
00:41:14,810 --> 00:41:17,640
I'm sorry for
causing problems, then!

598
00:41:46,710 --> 00:41:47,940
Here, catch.

599
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:54,920
Alright,

600
00:41:55,130 --> 00:41:56,160
