603
00:42:00,260 --> 00:42:01,160
Go.

604
00:42:04,610 --> 00:42:05,520
Does it look good?

605
00:42:06,490 --> 00:42:07,520
It smells amazing, Mom.

606
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:11,680
Don't grab it,
