607
00:42:12,300 --> 00:42:13,520
I'll feed you.

608
00:42:16,710 --> 00:42:17,800
Look at him,

609
00:42:18,090 --> 00:42:19,400
he plays soccer every day,

610
00:42:19,700 --> 00:42:21,530
now he's tanned
because of the sun.

611
00:42:23,540 --> 00:42:24,310
Hey,

612
00:42:24,330 --> 00:42:26,440
