613
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:28,400
Alright.

614
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:30,400
Thank you.

615
00:42:32,940 --> 00:42:33,900
Too big?

616
00:42:34,780 --> 00:42:35,520
Is it good?

617
00:42:35,910 --> 00:42:36,720
It's delicious.

618
00:43:01,110 --> 00:43:02,400
Thank you.

619
00:43:03,290 --> 00:43:04,520
After all this time...

620
00:43:04,890 --> 00:43:08,440
I feel like the luckiest woman in the world.

621
00:43:13,110 --> 00:43:14,440
I promise

622
00:43:15,800 --> 00:43:17,720
you'll be the only one I love forever.

623
00:43:22,160 --> 00:43:23,400
Kanthi, dear.

624
00:43:25,700 --> 00:43:26,640
Yes, Mom?

625
00:43:27,250 --> 00:43:28,600
I'm sorry

626
00:43:29,580 --> 00:43:31,760
