to watch all of your matches.

627
00:43:33,960 --> 00:43:35,720
But no matter where I am,

628
00:43:36,710 --> 00:43:39,160
I'll always be in your heart.

629
00:43:40,560 --> 00:43:41,760
I love you.

630
00:43:50,600 --> 00:43:52,360
You're going to be alright, Mom.

631
00:43:53,890 --> 00:43:54,640
Right,

632
00:43:55,200 --> 00:43:56,320
