633
00:43:57,130 --> 00:43:58,560
You'll get better soon.

634
00:43:59,700 --> 00:44:00,760
Hold on, alright?

635
00:44:06,780 --> 00:44:08,160
Don't cry, honey.

636
00:44:08,490 --> 00:44:09,880
Your mother will get better soon.

637
00:44:33,230 --> 00:44:33,890
Guys,

638
00:44:34,520 --> 00:44:35,520
