647
00:44:50,880 --> 00:44:51,840
Is that really it?

648
00:44:52,390 --> 00:44:54,280
Or do you have a date
with your sugar daddy?

649
00:44:59,290 --> 00:45:00,200
Don't mind him.

650
00:45:01,100 --> 00:45:03,920
Just think of it as
a barking dog.

651
00:45:04,410 --> 00:45:05,920
I kind of want to

652
00:45:05,940 --> 00:45:07,640
