653
00:45:16,100 --> 00:45:18,080
Oh, I thought you'd be more daring.

654
00:45:18,100 --> 00:45:19,680
Bring it on, come on.

655
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:20,760
That's enough, Jay.

656
00:45:24,400 --> 00:45:25,120
So...

657
00:45:25,380 --> 00:45:26,440
What is your errand?

658
00:45:27,170 --> 00:45:28,960
You forgot your friends now, huh?

659
00:45:29,600 --> 00:45:31,260
You don't hang out with us anymore.

660
00:45:34,230 --> 00:45:34,760
So?

661
00:45:35,210 --> 00:45:36,210
Yeah, yeah...

662
00:45:38,800 --> 00:45:39,680
Whose car is that?

663
00:45:44,320 --> 00:45:45,420
Mr. Gear,

664
00:45:47,200 --> 00:45:48,600
Mr. Kanthi told me to
come pick you up.

665
00:45:57,920 --> 00:45:59,760
You didn't have to
be this extra, though...

666
00:45:59,900 --> 00:46:01,230
It's Mr. Kanthi's orders.

667
00:46:01,250 --> 00:46:02,080
After you.

668
00:46:11,050 --> 00:46:12,320
I'll get going now.

669
00:46:46,910 --> 00:46:48,200
What I asked you to do,

670
00:46:48,710 --> 00:46:49,600
how is that going?

671
00:46:49,900 --> 00:46:51,120
It's going smoothly, Boss.

672
00:46:51,250 --> 00:46:52,000
But...

673
00:46:53,120 --> 00:46:53,680
But what?

674
00:46:54,320 --> 00:46:55,320
I can't contact the people

675
00:46:55,510 --> 00:46:56,800
I sent out last night.

676
00:46:57,310 --> 00:46:58,200
Does this mean...

677
00:46:58,510 --> 00:47:00,010
- they...
- Boss, Boss!

678
00:47:00,030 --> 00:47:00,760
Boss!

679
00:47:00,790 --> 00:47:01,400
What?

680
00:47:02,190 --> 00:47:04,080
The folks from Rose Club
are coming, Boss.

681
00:47:04,880 --> 00:47:05,810
What did you say?!

682
00:47:15,310 --> 00:47:16,820
Your guests have come all this way

683
00:47:17,810 --> 00:47:19,000
and you won't even
invite us to drink?

684
00:47:21,640 --> 00:47:22,640
Why are you here?

685
00:47:24,000 --> 00:47:25,890
I heard you were looking for
missing people.

686
00:47:27,320 --> 00:47:28,720
So I brought them here.

687
00:47:30,610 --> 00:47:32,020
Fuck, let go of me!

688
00:47:32,050 --> 00:47:32,910
Stay still!

689
00:47:33,030 --> 00:47:34,120
Sit down!

690
00:47:36,150 --> 00:47:36,920
Boss.

691
00:47:37,120 --> 00:47:38,120
Please help me, Boss.

692
00:47:38,400 --> 00:47:39,790
- Boss, Boss...
- Let go of me!

693
00:47:40,520 --> 00:47:41,360
Ow!

694
00:47:44,520 --> 00:47:45,880
Why are you treating them like that?

695
00:47:47,320 --> 00:47:49,500
They came and caused damage
to my pub.

696
00:47:50,010 --> 00:47:51,640
Just as you told them to.

697
00:47:51,930 --> 00:47:53,220
What the fuck are you talking about?!

698
00:47:53,300 --> 00:47:54,320
I wasn't in on it.

699
00:47:54,460 --> 00:47:55,600
Cut the bullshit, old man.

700
00:47:55,640 --> 00:47:56,790
What did you say?

701
00:48:01,210 --> 00:48:02,400
Make your choice.

702
00:48:03,620 --> 00:48:05,200
Your men will have to lower their guns.

703
00:48:06,020 --> 00:48:08,040
Or I'll shoot a few holes in your head.

704
00:48:13,180 --> 00:48:14,240
Didn't you hear what he said?

705
00:48:17,020 --> 00:48:17,720
Lower your guns!

706
00:48:30,130 --> 00:48:31,680
Let's try to be civil here.

707
00:48:33,000 --> 00:48:34,200
I understand

708
00:48:34,710 --> 00:48:35,960
that my pub opened after yours,

709
00:48:37,020 --> 00:48:38,080
yet it's more crowded.

710
00:48:38,820 --> 00:48:40,040
You might get a bit upset.

711
00:48:40,680 --> 00:48:41,560
But, sir,

712
00:48:42,960 --> 00:48:44,640
if you're going to be
my competitor,

713
00:48:44,810 --> 00:48:45,800
try not to stoop so low, will you?

714
00:48:47,060 --> 00:48:49,320
Act more like the Dragon of this district,

715
00:48:50,320 --> 00:48:51,680
rather than a cowardly dog.

716
00:48:54,730 --> 00:48:55,960
This time

717
00:48:57,650 --> 00:48:58,920
I'll let it go.

718
00:49:02,420 --> 00:49:03,760
But if there's a next time,

719
00:49:07,710 --> 00:49:09,360
I'll make you pay back tenfold.

720
00:49:20,630 --> 00:49:21,560
As for your gun,

721
00:49:22,480 --> 00:49:23,440
I'll be taking it

722
00:49:24,190 --> 00:49:25,200
as compensation

723
00:49:25,890 --> 00:49:27,120
for restoring my pub.

724
00:49:36,210 --> 00:49:36,920
Boss, I'm sorry.

725
00:49:37,070 --> 00:49:37,960
Boss.

726
00:49:38,920 --> 00:49:40,000
Fucker!

727
00:50:24,370 --> 00:50:25,120
Mr. Kanthi...

728
00:50:29,940 --> 00:50:31,040
You're here?

729
00:50:32,610 --> 00:50:33,360
Come,

730
00:50:34,100 --> 00:50:35,320
