731
00:50:44,920 --> 00:50:46,720
You drank this much...?

732
00:50:47,320 --> 00:50:48,320
Sit down.

733
00:50:48,710 --> 00:50:49,960
Come drink with me.

734
00:51:00,510 --> 00:51:01,620
Drink with me.

735
00:51:04,100 --> 00:51:04,880
Um...

736
00:51:05,690 --> 00:51:07,160
I think you're too drunk already.

737
00:51:07,370 --> 00:51:08,120
It's none of your business!

738
00:51:09,910 --> 00:51:10,910
Mr. Kanthi,

739
00:51:11,340 --> 00:51:12,760
if you drink any more than this,

740
00:51:12,830 --> 00:51:14,360
you might die.

741
00:51:15,920 --> 00:51:17,280
Good, then.

742
00:51:17,870 --> 00:51:19,710
That way, I'll finally get to be
with my mom.

743
00:51:24,940 --> 00:51:25,940
Mr. Kanthi!

744
00:51:28,900 --> 00:51:29,680
What's wrong with you?!

745
00:51:29,730 --> 00:51:31,020
I'm helping you!

746
00:51:31,940 --> 00:51:33,980
I don't know what happened,

747
00:51:34,310 --> 00:51:35,360
but do you really think

748
00:51:35,590 --> 00:51:37,400
your mother would be happy
if you died?!

749
00:51:38,400 --> 00:51:39,980
That's none of your fucking business.

750
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:41,320
Don't try to fucking lecture me!

751
00:51:42,070 --> 00:51:42,920
Get out!

752
00:51:44,870 --> 00:51:45,440
Go!

753
00:51:46,990 --> 00:51:47,720
Fine!

754
00:51:48,630 --> 00:51:49,880
I'll leave you be.

755
00:51:52,570 --> 00:51:53,320
Leave!

756
00:51:53,910 --> 00:51:55,200
Get out of my life!

757
00:51:56,110 --> 00:51:57,840
I don't need anyone!

758
00:51:58,170 --> 00:51:58,990
Go!

759
00:52:32,220 --> 00:52:33,360
Mr. Kanthi.

760
00:53:06,490 --> 00:53:09,960
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

761
00:53:09,980 --> 00:53:13,920
♫what love can be♫

762
00:53:13,940 --> 00:53:16,270
♫"Love" used to mean nothing,♫

763
00:53:16,290 --> 00:53:20,920
♫but now it's starting to have a meaning♫

764
00:53:21,620 --> 00:53:25,070
♫The love you gave me♫

765
00:53:25,090 --> 00:53:29,400
♫Is very fulfilling. You helped me realize♫

766
00:53:29,420 --> 00:53:36,990
♫that this love is meant for you and me♫

767
00:53:42,280 --> 00:53:43,240
Ah, you.

768
00:53:44,440 --> 00:53:45,360
Yes?

769
00:53:46,200 --> 00:53:47,320
Do you want to go to dinner with me?

770
00:53:47,420 --> 00:53:48,520
- Huh?
- Wait, wait, wait.

771
00:53:48,720 --> 00:53:49,840
I'm not trying to flirt.

772
00:53:50,200 --> 00:53:52,000
I just want to have dinner with you.

773
00:53:52,280 --> 00:53:53,160
Where are you going?

774
00:53:53,400 --> 00:53:54,120
I'm going home.

775
00:53:54,280 --> 00:53:55,860
Well... before you go,

776
00:53:55,880 --> 00:53:58,920
why don't we learn one more sex lesson?

777
00:53:59,040 --> 00:54:01,560
But I've kissed to the point that
my lips are raw.

778
00:54:01,660 --> 00:54:03,440
When will you teach me something else?

779
00:54:03,540 --> 00:54:05,640
The next lesson I'm going to teach you

780
00:54:06,360 --> 00:54:07,360
is oral sex.

781
00:54:09,200 --> 00:54:10,240
Yeah, like that.

782
00:54:26,240 --> 00:54:29,620
♫Thank you for teaching me♫

783
00:54:29,640 --> 00:54:33,720
♫What love can be♫

784
00:54:33,740 --> 00:54:35,980
♫"Love" used to mean nothing,♫

785
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:41,320
♫But now it's starting to have a meaning♫

786
00:54:41,340 --> 00:54:44,840
♫The love you gave me♫

787
00:54:44,860 --> 00:54:49,240
♫Is very fulfilling, you helped me realize♫

788
00:54:49,260 --> 00:54:56,880
♫That this love is meant for you and me♫
